: "The six sections form a ring. src sits directly above step 6, which is where most of its calls go.\nClockwise from the top left: solana connections, step 1, steps 2+3, steps 4+5, step 6, src, and back.\nCalls along one side stay on that side. Only calls that cross the ring meet in the middle.\nAn arrow takes the color of the section it leaves.", "originalText": "The six sections form a ring. src sits directly above step 6, which is where most of its calls go.\nClockwise from the top left: solana connections, step 1, steps 2+3, steps 4+5, step 6, src, and back.\nCalls along one side stay on that side. Only calls that cross the ring meet in the middle.\nAn arrow takes the color of the section it leaves.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}], "appState": {"theme": "light", "viewBackgroundColor": "#121212", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}